Firmware Release 04.08.09 (30) – CODESYS 3

Engineering by CODESYS IDE V. 3.5 is supported
Engineering by e!COCKPIT IDE is not supported
CODESYS 2.3 is not supported

Migration Guide – from e!COCKPIT to CODEYS V3.5:
• https://techdocs.wago.com/Software/eCOCKPIT_Migration/en-US/index.html#index_content

System
[NEW] DHCP-Vendor-Class-ID can be set in the electronic plate
[NEW] WAT-37496 Disabling operating switch and reset taster via WBM
[FIXED] WAT-36654
        WAT-37458 Broadcast/Multicast storm protection for 4-port devices
                  missing
[FIXED] WAT-38350 PFC300: Randomly disconnection by link down
[FIXED] WAT-37271 PFC300: Cannot be operated with the DALI configurator
[FIXED] WAT-37583 PFC300: Randomly flickering outputs in some special
                          applications
[FIXED] WAT-36811 Ethernet Settings displays wrong error code
[FIXED] WAT-37624 FW update stops at 71%
[FIXED]
[FIXED] WAT-37397 Outsourced home directory to sd could not be used by SFTP user
                  Solution: set up WBM configuration 
                            “Home directory on sd card enabled”
[DEPRECATED] The network feature rate limiting is deprecated and will be removed
             in future versions
[Note] ADVICE Code generation from WDA OpenAPI is possible via Postman
[DEPRECATED] Webserver module PHP-PAM will be removed in future versions

