[NEW] CODESYS PAM connection can be setup in “etc/codesys3.d/RtsCore.cfg”
[NOTE] ADVICE PFC300: The behavior of the DAL watchdog may change on multicore
                      systems. 
                      If a high-priority IEC task on a core displaces all other
                      IEC tasks on this core, the BUS is no longer driven into a
                      defined state via the watchdog, as the system and
                      therefore other IEC tasks on other cores can still be
                      executed.
                      For controlled behavior, it is recommended to use the
                      CODESYS internal task watchdog.

