Firmware Release 04.07.50 (29) – CODESYS 3

Engineering by CODESYS IDE V. 3.5 is supported
Engineering by e!COCKPIT IDE is not supported
CODESYS 2.3 is not supported

Migration Guide – from e!COCKPIT to CODEYS V3.5:
• https://techdocs.wago.com/Software/eCOCKPIT_Migration/en-US/index.html#index_content

System
[CHANGED] Firewall is setup by default as active.
[NEW] Forcing password rules. 8 characters containing special character,
      upper/lower case, 1 digit
[NEW] Password history, 3 passwords
[CHANGED] User User is deactivated for console access
[CHANGED] User Root is deactivated for ssh console and WBM
[CHANGED] User User cannot change the password in the WBM settings
[NEW] Groups WagoUpload and FWupdate
[CHANGED] User User has limited access rights for the WBM
[CHANGED] Open IP-ports by default: https 443, ssh 22
[CHANGED] Open VPN IP-ports by default: https 443, ssh 22
[CHANGED] No WAN IP ports by default
[CHANGED] Service interface is unassigned by default
[CHANGED] Commissioning service is deactivated by default
[KNOWN] WAT37135 Passwords in WBM can only be changed one times

